{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find object. If found, take it, check properties. Move and store it. Do task. Otherwise, scan area and move.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObjectStorage    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = StoreObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTaskSubtree    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextArea    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInRange    />",
